   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Infinite Bento Pan\n\nA hypnotic diagonal camera glide over an oversized grid of bento cards (charts, counters, code, gradients) with a vignette. All figures are filler.\n\nCategory: compositions. Length: 10 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- You need an ambient establishing shot that says a lot is happening here without asking anyone to read a number.\n- A background layer is wanted behind a title or logo, with dozens of dashboard cards drifting past.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The figures on screen have to mean something: every counter, stat and chart here is filler; use a real chart block.\n- You need the camera to slow down, hold or land on one card: the pan is a single linear diagonal.\n\nVariables:\n- pan_speed (number, 0.25-3): Pan distance, default 1\n- accent_color (color): Accent, default \"#7c3aed\"\n- speed (number, 0.25-4): Speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
